{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Prepares for Final Exams", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Great Sounding Board", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for and Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are many ways to ask for and to give advice.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What should I do?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should try to maintain as many routines as you can. <br/> <br/> <br/>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Here are some expressions you can use to ask for and to give advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you suggest?</p>  How do you suggest I ... ?</p>  Do you have any advice for ... ?</p>  What should I do?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's good to ...</p>  I strongly advise ...</p>  Why don't you ... ?</p>  You should try to ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Permission", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you ask for permission, it is important to be polite.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You often use a modal like <span class=\"italic\">can</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to ask for permission.</p>  You can also ask a Yes or No question like <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIs it OK if \u2026 \u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cWould you mind if \u2026 \u201d</span></p>  Here are some ways to ask for and give permission.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I tell you about my problems?</p>   Would you mind if I asked a question?</p>  Can I take that course next term?</p>  Could I use your textbook this evening?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, go ahead.</p>  Not at all. I'd be happy to help.</p> Yes, you can.</p> OK, no problem.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to balance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put the same amount of importance on two or more things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm having a hard time balancing my work and part-time studies. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to give advice about school.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "studies", "type": "name"}, {"content": "courses or program of study", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My studies are very demanding this term. I have five courses.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "statistics", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the study of probability (a branch of mathematics)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Next term I have to take Statistics!  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "music appreciation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a course about the history and styles of music", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Music Appreciation is an easy course.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to skip", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to miss; to not do something you usually do", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't skip your workouts at the gym.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to circulate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move around (often blood in the body)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Just walk around the room to get the blood circulating.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to maintain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to keep in the same way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should try to maintain your daily routines. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sounding board", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who listens to a person talking about their problems", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thanks for the help. You're a great sounding board! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Ask 4-6 people the question: <span class=\"italic\">Is it difficult to balance work and studies? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask the person to give a reason.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the responses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a summary of your results.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your results to the class.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I survey 4-6 people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I count answers and reasons.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present the results.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Hi Vanessa!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey Peter, how's it going?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Not very well. Can I tell you about my problems?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure, go ahead.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm having a hard time balancing my work with part-time studies.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's a common problem."}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I feel stressed. I'm taking HR and Accounting courses. They're not easy, like English, Spanish or Music Appreciation. Next term I have to take Statistics!  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, that's hard.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I don't get enough sleep, and I make more mistakes than I should.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh Peter, everyone expects mistakes from you.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What should I do?"}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "38000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should try to maintain your daily routines. Don't skip your workouts at the gym. Take lots of shorts breaks. Just walk around the room to get the blood circulating.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, Vanessa! That's great advice. You're a great sounding board!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Anytime, my friend!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about subjects to study.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for and give permission.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask for and respond to advice.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Is it difficult to balance work and studies? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Who do you talk to when you have problems at work or with your studies", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Can I tell you about my problems?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter needs advice! Vanessa's a great sounding board!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorr